# PRABAS restricted days (no non-veg). One entry per line; columns separated by "|".
# After editing, run `npm run catalog` and commit.
#
# THESE DATES MUST BE CHECKED AGAINST A TRUSTED PANCHANGAM. They were read on 2026-10-01
# from published Tamil calendars for Chennai; none were calculated or guessed. Every one is
# seeded unverified, for someone at home to confirm in the app (Calendar, in Settings).
# Where the sources disagreed, both days are listed: both stay veg-only until confirmed.
#
# Sources:
#   drikpanchang      https://www.drikpanchang.com (Chennai: geoname-id 1264527)
#   tamildailycalendar https://www.tamildailycalendar.com
#   goldenchennai     https://calendar.goldenchennai.com
#   tamildot          https://calendar.tamildot.com
#   prokerala         https://www.prokerala.com/general/calendar/tamilcalendar.php
#
# type: amavasai, kiruthigai, puratasi. end_date: the last day, for puratasi only.
# label: blank for the usual name. sources: who lists this date. note: anything to check.
#
date|end_date|type|label|sources|note

